findings.detail:
The approved spec is pinned, and these behaviours are not in it:
- RS_PLAN_RATE_LIMIT and RS_PLAN_RATE_WINDOW_MIN (FU-14);
- RS_GENERAL_RATE_LIMIT (1-100000, default 300) and RS_GENERAL_RATE_WINDOW_SEC (1-3600, default 60);
- the order Origin -> 401 -> 429 general -> role 403 -> CSRF 403;
- a confirm that equals the latest version in values AND derived provenance and wording returns that version without a row.
I accept all four. The names, bounds and defaults are reasonable, and the env-example scan asserts them.
